  "_readme": "Eval Suite V0.1 (ASTRA.md). mode=text runs in agent/evals/run_evals.py against a local backend; mode=audio needs the WebRTC harness (scripts/scripted_calls.py). Checks marked critical block a release. Add an eval for every meaningful real failure.",
